    "directions": [
      "In a small kadai or handi, add ghee, once it's hot, add sella basmati rice and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add apricots, water, saffron water, sugar, cloves, green cardamom, water and mix well.",
      "Cover it with a lid and let it cook for 12-15 minutes on low flames or until cooked well.",
      "Finish it with fried nuts, remaining sugar, little water and give it a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl or dish, garnish it with mint sprig and fried nuts.",
      "Serve hot.",
      "In a pan, add ghee, once its hot, add pistachios, almonds, dry coconut, cashew nuts and fry them until golden in colour.",
      "Add fennel seeds, crushed black peppercorns and give it a good mix.",
      "Turn off the flames and keep it aside for further use."
    ],
